{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1186,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de52ae479e70a056bbc2956c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜～不被小圣王提醒我都没发现自己头发睡得乱糟糟的！\r\n这样子怎么配得上这件决胜服嘛～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4147ff1d493b41f93141650d8916d844a41f40aca320dd5116fcda55b2ff3b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07eb3c03367a35e5525ac03b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以日本第一为目标的话，就得要文武双全。\r\n不仅脚力充沛，在学习上也要出类拔萃……\r\n我在课上真的学到了很多呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c4f3822062ac27c4e404c5f3ee48c4c9dace6560222f54df4ea1884b331ea93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bce70631f0bb8769be7a61dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近老是会梦到关于比赛的梦呢。\r\n“我拿下了冠军、大家都为我高兴”——\r\n这一切绝对，会让它成为现实的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5b981ea7fed1eb845da8dde8e843388773bbe6ad4b498969a6eb6535d10c6a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c82f4769103294e26a3003e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天是牛奶很好喝的季节哟～！\r\n作为北海道的宣传赛马娘，\r\n可要努力宣传家乡才行♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cada754cf8d63d78cadb541e092e25267b662218dce52a6f377b687f2e8b2354",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f530b4edfeafc926238a30a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "沙滩排球和潜水，还有还有……\r\n总之就是好好玩乐，\r\n一起制霸夏天吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3af41b2a9ca6cc6086a7d39b583623fe3a8094522b3e853c80bf9ee70ab75a5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0564ea2d28c6c3643e9a2496",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "防波堤钓什么的真有意思啊～！\r\n我和小青一起钓到了很多秋季才有的鱼哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "43592e61e7187a5e32c30c4ac9aadeec33e9dfbeaf0e703d1cfcba7d312294c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f221b886b58dddfe389cbd00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一直都很想堆一次雪屋呢～\r\n老家附近的雪，散散的很难堆起来呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "38ebcd357b4d6c62a6df59a39fbf8adf450a06248ddfd87b932662a4d8ceb5f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c98588980f0bcba8cf284091",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼，吾乃日本第一的\r\n特别周总大将是也～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddc4a264b34f6306cb8640a0fec381576cc7bba6605a08232df927c42fcbc8f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc192b606056d151a3ae7805",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家的思念就是我的锦之御旗……\r\n从今以后，我也会和这件决胜服一起继续赢下去的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae6069ef1eb7d4e34ffa88e758f9846ac6f0ab1dca70ee5dbfc56a888fddd327",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:027ec7305008d10aaf19bd7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要做什么？\r\n不管是什么训练我都会加油的～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ea1b0ee7cd488619cfd5602af44e58cb3ad2d45259ef081a52adf04aa504201",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2826425351f5768c59e64044",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いきますっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0ee723306ea339f8c53c617bbeb0d8bbc8544bca51ccba4a801db3248f22b95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91f909e12f36bb8d1e70556d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好ー，要加油咯ー！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90363ac0f9e8c24824501626c55fc9e78ee98606d7738cf1d615e86a458c2d35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f0aec366f63d1de5cde9a8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鞋子的状态、没问题！\r\n伸展训练、没问题！\r\n随时都可以开始训练！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27c74e16c4f9352de2fa98546bf293f195ab32ff77509f2d68ca916bd380078b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac2f586e2c8e00130391df21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，\r\n请下指示吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "032aa8a589d1ce8d33f16647404cbab90b96ae17b549e7e0e0b2b085e2a8a42f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9263c94e5f8bf74efd75c05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我变强了的样子，真想早点让\r\n妈妈也看到啊…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa8c1bdf0bb1b9083fadf3805d4cd2a466a941a52f4128e3e0131e529c1c7a77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8296d7973f01e8ca1b12230b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然大家跑得都很快…\r\n但我也不会输的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "010cdfbab197cbc2d0496c6f356bfe8cafb8d1b21cfec8c14f454eca50bba817",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a5bec4c13cae89f353778cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还只是在逐梦的路上而已！\r\n为了能够变得更加强大，\r\n还请多多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9eeacdc14cf56a38d1ac47eae872dc4d24ff680513d202bf2c85383a994abd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8224b56cb762ad182af4764",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了赢得比赛，我要好好地\r\n锻炼自己！！\r\n请多指教！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e17db5d5d4775593a74373feecd699825db3c664ae82b8f908f03fa894a37195",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b89c4548053ac53ad4b73dfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "激浪般地前进吧ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd43a3cbad092c4cd535d233b66cf69f26ebc45c2f63d8acc82d6aa38e06406c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ada1c308f76cf647d4e5d82b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更为精进的轻盈姿态，\r\n就请好好见证吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2579f25fd34ac7629a5fdded5080066d428976d9a11970b0ff8e07772df7f331",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a38501c05dd2467cdfbd3b8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "像太阳一般热烈，我会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "26ee0719312acef19babfa6758b495fc60047647737cd0a0df2a3a34b13dfd75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8070199b0aab8d274a2a0bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Let's Go Go♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "69b92b01e86debd0016782ccc65c12977b83ae7097012511634d7c5251266c8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:791d6ba6e0ef5249dac57aa2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体好轻…\r\n感觉好像什么都能做到♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d016f2c44655b4923aa330b35f7c0cbf6cae293fab184c6a96659bca4759046",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a75bf09848ac7d64f2c55649",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管天气有多热，\r\n只要跳进泳池里…\r\n就立马能够凉快下来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff2cd67a93f3f850062fa61b7407ba73ecc97e70360711fb4c279fb1ab040243",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:167a4f566bda82d8b30cf332",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是怎样的试炼，\r\n我都能够乘风破浪！现在的我，\r\n就算是鄂霍次克海的骇浪也不在话下！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cceebc2b1bf3c8a0cf8c96a55da59645b81cb41ba04e6295072d7d7dac482066",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83d4d0498281adde14440a87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么！为了向着梦想继续努力，\r\n今天也好好加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84bb82b564124ec2a6091deb3d0d176d3a9e5abc80965f83abb6e2ac91eace16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b0f0fe3a056513ba586ba11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们一起在赛场上取得天下吧！\r\n梦想也会“咚咚”地变大的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca6a87caf2c658f1196d9ba8683b46d73a6318d9860502ea3800d659690daaa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bad5804742389bb6c7d0fa15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要进行什么训练呢？是要冲坡道，\r\n还是说要锻炼肌肉呢？为了补充营养\r\n先吃饭也是没问题的哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b95c974a054a0b7b9f4c15c9310930daedfe782ad978d1ced9821a2047d290cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:475dad71c470c1b945a5231c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是怎样的训练都放马过来吧！\r\n毕竟如果要以日本第一为目标的话，\r\n可得要样样精通呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2e4871b13467902272fda416895e8cc93550c0f93c45bd291ef3ad37777a688",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89a481b0cf15ecca4c709d89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏了有训练员在，\r\n我终于明白我想要成为的“日本第一”\r\n是怎样的了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0a89da993951c9a7740c74e3893c67c3baff79c2c323cb8f71abe07f5934bf4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b44e305e0cbf4a7b6be91d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最大的敌人，就是想要放弃的心……\r\n不过，只要跟训练员在一起的话，\r\n就能够一心向前跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "305df363a46c0b288f57e19834a9000c7f6df336a079c964a3740576c702ab5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d63b8a238285f7a1e379a831",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员的梦想，\r\n我也会好好地承载并跑下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f198813752f82a411ce2e1dad214c10916dfe47a3ba2a3aa5b2476c3a77b8322",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e721c7f3ecf242cba4daf7a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有成为训练员的骄傲吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab49f8dbe081b53a5340ef559b9aeb855ea7390bc3a99bee21ffd52939172d0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e40721b855431b822d7da2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这下能够自豪地向母亲报喜了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b62c4c95524da121eaca80dfdf11ba6a022a46041881058e1eba6b7ca9394a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcdb244484590e9dcdd5620f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在也好、未来也好…\r\n继续热情地闪耀吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "462b026889f088bcda8b4094d437c54a8879006b3dc74a6c89a82d5c174cf625",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10245b180e08974470112b3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这些日子成为了我无可替代的回忆！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8a5ba0915313e56bcf8c024496be117c81c6ff95a9f47c53aecd6073b36d4a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:feb074778984f7f7e7ce1932",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的训练员可是日本第一棒的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfec9d48aaea167db1c2938941dffa692d1bb3209e6585c04e01ec4edcfa2f22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9d0b7b202c81e7a31302177",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“特别”的梦想，已经被我紧紧抓住了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dea32366c4f165faf0dabbd0a728a8fd5474dcf1187bc4ca88860dc568dbe787",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f733b26af9bff2fb7817ea53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦，力量从身体里涌出来了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f753f51eb5d61cfcdcdab9c5a2f90dddbc00165d1cd364aaebad98ee346cbf3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82a1192e8ed880c36ff91334",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还能变得更强…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f20ff43e6e6dbf7ac5ba5698119697ff9cc36ba52ea1d46cc06bd7375a7b772a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c1dcd046eac0aa6f20f6cbd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是，我是特别周！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04d7e44aedae3f12f459bb47b88d57c3618e3ac4bb35b70021b412b269304828",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffb6bc73863f1131c340b12b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了能够成为值得骄傲的自己！\r\n我…会赢得胜利的！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "73a81dd4584283af44667dff6f595bb72802016ed4aa8d58d70c3a79c3706f0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abbe45882992c777b81e9812",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我说不定能成为可靠的赛马娘呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e40552f1785bf2ce306eabba85712b61ab3a6feba778368d7cb6e8a044ec8c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48af37b61cc1a9c3c77c17c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像我还能够成为大家的力量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "96d59a88c70df29b1fad192c682a6f6b3049a12087ed9baf1ca73b6f4e1ac0b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56aba76d0d4049ceaeb0838c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "热起来了呢ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e470641cdc27f7eb3ae8881ac7d41bb6d33c8cffffe8bc869e18129e5646145",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4acbe098d5f5a8d1cfd6b6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个开放感…最棒了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "93841ad5a8693ad66a8a5328e6ccc9b0d9062434c5893f3302e454db30d276d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35deff31cb014386589a1a8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把这个夏天，\r\n变成难忘的回忆吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4e0f7de31826785b03f59504752bf236a07adc98e5efd59d0a7fa97ee1ef4e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24470622cfc859da636e03d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是特别周！\r\n我会像盛夏的阳光一样，闪闪发光♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "307ce65770218400df63e86bbbf1630c8d6e8452ca3d6fe1bc5b29bb964300da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a7d4c8119df93ac9b7ea1a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还会继续不断成长的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f53b203cf744efbaf42c8b350b99f66ce76ee4f6273f5f876d0191404e75e4d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e0b8ae52e790dd1f23289ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "超越自己的极限，成为真正的日本第一！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97c1258fefeb081d798b685cbda299d019a64bdf2ab3622887ecb88e73fae6e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7f3d148d137c806a081fa20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将承载着大家梦想的——\r\n日本第一的跑姿传达给所有人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a943440a5c380cbcf1a85810f9295da74b48879835302e2dfe7845aa67606a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02c2f161eebe9210d02e6b9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是特别周，\r\n目标是日本第一！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7b44a73a5f40104affc55e47fc4607d2cf6dde9e82f3a345d19b619498d2b98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75e53acfedd93199ab2abeb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "才不会输……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56891a3fffb316b06e2286c1fbe5382dea197a33e6ed62e8092cc1228a12c699",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9141389ed211eed687f4c7ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果训练员一直对我的奔跑\n心怀信心，那我也能胸怀自信地\n在这条路上奔跑到底。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b191e49e469ecb65fb751074dd9dd8133defa3334904c1b1bb59f08e3ba62108",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fae7c4a9b6115919a48bba4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いってきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "708d48f999ca231f298df5a3e890f17164021562c4776f58afb4c74b8d84703d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40312d6c6662f0fa1fac2d90",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま帰りました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "481ece6b5ae3f39ab09cef14164dcd64ddd6f960e487ca411576688b02f8f52f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cdca5f464d9c8f1a119fd5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和训练员在一起的话，\n不擅长的事情也稍微习惯一些了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "892f30d24216281e72e082ea20cf3036e657b1e095de039b5a35fe90f140f6ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce0bdd8600a2bf5baac6193b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我以前以为，\n只有我一人看见的景色才是最棒的。\n但现在……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dddedf689ed5848434ca5709afd1e7e47b1c6908e3984112c7ccc607b466bf7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b97348c2b51278506d280c51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "终于来了……！现在正是装饰那棵福来送给我的\n大门松的时候……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "05200ac7ca1cd83e7553b4ac04cf1bcd54d59d1ed1250211d92c971ed8922c7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ce507bc32827e4e37496ebf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家吃了好多巧克力……\n吃这么多的话，不会影响比赛吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e73fc420cead20c4bb8fd5ab3118489f8c38ded6ffa417d4f89ddfd88278304",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a8141fad5c5c804dbcd4f47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能请你收下这个吗？\n因为昨天晚上才意识到今天是情人节，\n所以只是一般的松露巧克力……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6c6b882e3596b771fb38c2700b4694cc14b98665d0e0237f0a0f9c416b790d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd9c7fa6bd5d8f9ec6555c0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在星空之下奔跑，真的很有意思。\n不过很容易撞到什么东西，\n必须小心一些……",
      "source_fingerprint": "65647b414d69b9ee2c105d8fbf93e2b5612857567ca49be388c6b0cd30a949a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3233f8b2460de0c809652f2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『不给糖果就捣蛋。\n不给我点心的话我就一直追着你。』\n说是这样说……你觉得怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "49e44c308397e40bb3d9ee177799efecc9624543454fa8db6dfcf9bf29e13e81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b234f869e47b114cdfdb507",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪后的枞树看上去，\n就像是自然装点的圣诞树呢……\n在它旁边跑的话，好像会很舒服的样子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c00f94fbb6cc107ea1802a8d50e9c1db68399e0ee8b717ff4b22a42cb24df0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dc3d58396dc715b9a927e06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要去看看圣诞节的灯彩吗？\n像下雪一样忽闪忽闪的，我很喜欢呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b706fd1d1f3627c563aa5b816bdc84120f0fe05558cd87f5b354e102f830b5f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef68ff5af2ab39bd0b73490a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是场不错的比赛呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58ed737834cd61dca095efd33d10ef7afb89ab81d4ef1a462933c44b1bd70bb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47f0e1ac982d3f2b160f960e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为这个时候的和尚们会忙得四处奔走，所以12月才又叫做“师走”对吧。\n稍微有点想看看呢、奔跑着的和尚……",
      "source_fingerprint": "664bff2d7cf1f6187156535ea2a975221d7ab2d6709f17667cf73a86890020f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5ca986b474fd48672e3f274",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐。\n就让我把胜利作为礼物送给你吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb494cf0338dcfa4adf5e506e16f76d9bf453f05707fa3584b60b0ca9bbf8f89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c41e9014e6a76ade8dd62b72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好不容易过一次生日，要不要做些难忘的事情？\n去看看只有高处才能看见的风景什么的……\n怎么样呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c3b11373fa6166f8107f2586180f315bdc6d468aa544cb0b056bc6c1e3c5a3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a436d1d3b85a6cd2119dcd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，今天是我的生日啊……\n完全沉迷在奔跑之中，\n不小心就忘了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c0cd59a7d50085d540222c0c754d3eac9cd53190b39672e93829780de5ba7dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a54d2e84325289a299b94ed9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "值得回忆的事情变多了，\n难以忘怀的景色也变多了。\n当然，其中也有训练员的身影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfb1237f21fb1485b7714337fcd2f861afd5e5f55c80a0102b9c315f40177ce6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41ed2ac2ab6c061d6fcab4a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新公告。\n要看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "05b332ec397d149d655b0f690e145762a4a0860549ec70c9e2bba3afb0e3b294",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29b8e79b8f2beb72c8d69b07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物呢。\n去看看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6ca8442952d41020630a8a85671f4216c8a75fb9c271e738bd1badbf3d1f89c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83e8595c045a659fa28c8533",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成。\n就这样一鼓作气向前冲吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f505885d2ec2b556c36bd36d16d262d35629c4e9552d84fc4f63cc4d9ebdaca2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96200aa544cc0237316b6e78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动要开始了。\n会是怎样的活动呢……\n……能让我尽情奔跑就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3115801c6c8b4c06eaeb79d30f7796f850e068fa7ba2ecdf8cb990f90ec5ceee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27151138a4d792a37964c2e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动已经开始了。\n让我也去跑跑吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c085a66e0d452c21e750d15b07697e2dd764c3ac23dd6a9e60bc9dbda7fb1dbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85ef1509ef7342d180fc8908",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次可要赢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f560d585a1ad71f7b33476ea25dcef10be8fdc5a016d29bb4d2451a95fc1e0de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53b046c923f5aabe7447ba34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴的等级好像提升了",
      "source_fingerprint": "eccf2403e15236f859c7d9ef041839222c29ded38ba491e7f1de3364095447a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2f1b051f63708621e5284e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服的颜色，和我奔跑时\r\n所看到的风景色调很像。\r\n光是穿在身上就觉得很舒服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d48787dbf6a1f2ea0bb8f9989d15396310ffc16659870091e38503f9d860970",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d912a055d0b3b35d9b6326c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要气槽看见我的蝴蝶结歪掉，\r\n便会替我重新绑好。\r\n她双手的动作非常漂亮呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fb5e3569a5c3d6e29e955e2f4c6ac8b66fbdec49171fd0706395ea6b7df2e77",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1002",
        "10026"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
